{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1477781-playable-characters-with-dread-powers","id":1477781,"title":"Playable characters with dread powers?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-03-31T09:38:56-07:00","id":1477781,"title":"Playable characters with dread powers?","content":"I understand that centimany are mainly designed to be antagonists, but really they are a playable option, and one of their plwers involves adquiring dread powers, are they even balanced with each other and with other powers or i should just ban them in case any player ends up having access to the mutation transmutation?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27340-anyoneatall","name":"Anyoneatall","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-31T10:24:01-07:00","id":1477789,"title":"","content":"IME the Dread Powers aren't imbalanced exactly. I'd use the phrase &quot;not rigorous.&quot; That is, as things designed for the ST, Dread Powers aren't usually written with consideration for how they might interact with this or that power, and so on. They're meant to be something of a self-contained alternative to using the more specific power sets of the different supernaturals.<br /> <br /> I don't think you need to preemptively ban them, but I would put a caveat out to my players that you might modify the letter of the rules to stay true to the spirit of the rules as it were. Make it clear that getting some Dread Powers to have a few special tricks is fine, but any attempt to power game things because a Dread Power doesn't have a wording about stacking or something isn't going to fly.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-31T10:37:52-07:00","id":1477791,"title":"","content":"If you're wary of using dread powers, you might consider using the deviations and scars from deviant, assuming you have that game. They are more rigorous than dread powers are, having been created with player characters in mind; but they're also flexible enough to handle the wide variety of inhuman capabilities that dread powers are supposed to represent.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-31T13:03:31-07:00","id":1477798,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1477781-playable-characters-with-dread-powers?p=1477791#post1477791\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you're wary of using dread powers, you might consider using the deviations and scars from deviant, assuming you have that game. They are more rigorous than dread powers are, having been created with player characters in mind; but they're also flexible enough to handle the wide variety of inhuman capabilities that dread powers are supposed to represent.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would probably do that if i had deviant :_)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27340-anyoneatall","name":"Anyoneatall","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-31T19:44:55-07:00","id":1477821,"title":"","content":"To be fair about wariness, if The Feast of Shulpae and Hototogisu are comfortable with basically saying &quot;Here's Dread Powers&quot; for their respective endowments, than a PC Centimani is probably not gonna make that big of a splash.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}